abstract: "Rhine / Western-Europe low-water inland shipping impacts: Bedoya-Maya et al. 2024 (throughput under critical water levels), Vinke et al. 2022 (cascade mechanics, Rhine 2018), Kaub 78 cm operational consensus, IfW Kiel 2018 GDP note. Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge -- see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P130. Complements glacier-buffer-utac (P99) without rederiving it."
